@startuml
top to bottom direction
skinparam state {
  BorderColor black
  BackgroundColor white
}

[*] --> Running : process created

Running --> Waiting : request blocked\n(no free instance or unsafe)
Waiting --> Running : resource granted\nor rollback (Preempt)

Running --> Completed : all operations done
Running --> Terminated : victim selected\n(Terminate)
Waiting --> Terminated : victim selected\n(Terminate)

Completed --> [*]
Terminated --> [*]

note right of Waiting
  Deadlocked is a flag,
  not a state. Granting,
  releasing, and rollback
  inside Running are shown
  in the sequence diagrams.
end note
@enduml